{"title":"Milton High School Math Tournament","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Milton High School Math Tournament</b> was an annual high-school <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_tournament\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math tournament\">math tournament</a> that was held by Milton High School, in Fulton (formerly Milton) County, Georgia, for thirteen years.  Evidently, the test was rather <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www2.fultonschools.org/teacher/pricea2/MathVarsity/2006%20tournament/ranking.xls\">difficult</a> for the competitors.  Unfortunately, there have been no recent signs that the tournament will continue.  The most recent competition was held in February 2006.  The website contains results from that year, as well as problems from 2001 onward.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Milton_High_School_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www2.fultonschools.org/teacher/pricea2/MathVarsity/MVarsityMilTourn.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Georgia mathematics competitions\">Georgia mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gctm.org/math_competitions.htm\">Schedule of Georgia mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018095613\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006